{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-04-13 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE TO DIVEST FOUR BUSINESSES TO THE JORDAN COMPANY', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF. , APRIL 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS TIME AND FREQUENCY, LOADRITE, SPECTRA PRECISION TOOLS AND SECO ACCESSORIES BUSINESSES TO PRECISIONAL LLC, AN AFFILIATE OF THE JORDAN COMPANY\xa0("TJC").'}